NAME
       df - report file system disk space usage

SYNOPSIS
       df [-hi]

DESCRIPTION
       Show total, used and available space on the root file system, with a
       usage bar on color terminals.

OPTIONS
       -h
           print sizes in human readable format

       -i
           list inode information instead of block usage

EXAMPLES
       df -h

SEE ALSO
       du(1), free(1)
